<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδόκιμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not legal tender, not
				current</i>, of coin, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				742a
			</span></i>; <i>not approved</i>, of horses, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				49.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unsatisfactory, unconvincing</i>, of a statement, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				76.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				576.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>disreputable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λακίσματ᾽ ἀδόκιμ᾽ ὀλβίοις ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					497
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					829d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.36
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					5.160
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of persons,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				618b
			</span></i>; <i>discredited, reprobate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>, <i>2 Ep.Tim.</i><i><span class="en">
				3.8
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
